  ('f52cc6d2-17bf-569d-b788-140dfee4fd91', '4fdfea61-47aa-5ba1-ba2d-6037a97e68f1', '7cce73f8-326a-5272-b117-b364aae4128d', 'reporting_ministry', null, 'respondent', 'select_one', 'Which ministry/institution are you responding for?', 'តើអ្នករាយការណ៍សម្រាប់ក្រសួង ឬស្ថាប័នណាដែរ?', 'Only indicators assigned to the selected ministry/institution will appear. Admin can see all indicators.', true, null, 4),
  ('9e01fcc1-55e6-5d03-8e56-9eeb606e09e3', '4fdfea61-47aa-5ba1-ba2d-6037a97e68f1', '7cce73f8-326a-5272-b117-b364aae4128d', 'ind_001_value', 'b6790427-6880-5019-8e61-836c4d8bb4a2', 'value', 'integer', 'How many technical documents, guidance documents, or video clips were produced or disseminated during the reporting period for Technical documents or video clips on: 
- Soil types and cashew cultivation techniques 
- Branch arrangement 
- Fertilizer use 
- Pesticide use 
- Harvesting 
- Cashew nut standards 
- Post-harvest techniques and flavoring?', 'តើចំនួនឯកសារបច្ចេកទេស ឯកសារណែនាំ ឬឃ្លីបវីដេអូដែលបានផលិត ឬផ្សព្វផ្សាយក្នុងអំឡុងពេលរាយការណ៍នេះ សម្រាប់ប្រធានបទខាងក្រោម មានប៉ុន្មាន?
